      "content": "\"We're so sorry to hear that your breakfast experience at Oceanview Boutique didn't quite meet your expectations. But we want you to know that we're already working on a plan to make it even better! Our team is passionate about delivering exceptional service, and we're committed to making sure every guest feels welcome, cared for, and delighted. We're grateful for your feedback, and we're using it to fuel our efforts to become the best version of ourselves. Thank you for choosing Oceanview Boutique - we can't wait to serve you again and show you the warmth and hospitality that we're all about!\"\n\nThis version is more overtly positive and enthusiastic, with a focus on the hotel's commitment to excellence and its passion for delivering exceptional service. The language is bright, cheerful, and uplifting, with a sense of excitement and energy. The goal is to make the customer feel like they're part of a special community, and that the hotel is dedicated to making them feel loved and appreciated.",
